{"availability":"available","full":"Lab700xOrg/aisbom","name":"aisbom","description":"Static security scanner for ML model files — detects pickle bombs, Keras Lambda RCE and GGUF template injection, and generates CycloneDX / SPDX AI-BOMs (AIBOM) as EU AI Act, CRA and FDA §524B evidence.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":81,"forks":7,"created":"2025-12-07T05:39:07Z","updated":"2026-10-03T05:33:08Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.aisbom.io/","topics":["ai-bom","ai-security","aibom","cra","cyber-resilience-act","cyclonedx","cyclonedx-sbom","eu-ai-act","huggingface","llm-security","machine-learning-security","malware-detection","mlbom","mlops","mlsecops","model-scanning","pytorch","sbom","spdx","supply-chain-security"],"demo":"https://aisbom.io/?ref=cli-readme","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.089Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.089Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.089Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.089Z","stars":81,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Detect malware and license risks hidden inside ML model files — statically, before you load them.","AIsbom disassembles Pickle bytecode, inspects Keras configs for code-executing Lambda layers, reads GGUF chat templates for Jinja sandbox escapes, walks ONNX graphs for custom operators and escaping external-data paths, and parses SafeTensors / GGUF binary headers — surfacing RCE-capable payloads and restrictive licenses that generic SBOM tools miss. Pure static analysis: no model is ever loaded, and no payload is ever executed, rendered, or unmarshalled.","💡 Also available as a GitHub Action that posts an idempotent PR comment on every commit. See it on the Marketplace →"],"features":["The security risk. PyTorch (.pt) files are Zip archives containing Pickle bytecode. A malicious model executes arbitrary code (RCE) the moment it's loaded.","The legal risk. A developer might download a \"non-commercial\" model (e.g., CC-BY-NC) and ship it to production. The license is embedded in the binary header — standard SBOM tools miss it entirely.","The regulatory risk. What ships inside a model is increasingly something you have to document. The EU AI Act puts general-purpose AI models under Article 53, with technical documentation described in Annex XI. The EU…","The solution. AIsbom looks inside. We decompile bytecode and parse binary metadata headers without loading the heavy weights into memory."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lab700xOrg/aisbom/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"19717588128dc9b11c03b9949abb716ce220dc31d0d9010dc5112ab0d52a78ba","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.222Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.222Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Detect malware and license risks hidden inside ML model files — statically, before you load them.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lab700xOrg/aisbom/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Get a per-repo token at (sign in with GitHub).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lab700xOrg/aisbom/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"19717588128dc9b11c03b9949abb716ce220dc31d0d9010dc5112ab0d52a78ba","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lab700xOrg/aisbom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.222Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T05:33:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lab700xOrg/aisbom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:27.225Z","hash":"19717588128dc9b11c03b9949abb716ce220dc31d0d9010dc5112ab0d52a78ba","originalBytes":56846,"storedBytes":56846,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["aisbom","scan","model","file","pickle","never","bash","license","vex","sbom","every","token","each","run","code","critical","models","only","risk","component","see","telemetry","one","rather","same","score","what","face","files","hugging","scans","ou